WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:11.065
"Alert!" Soldier cried one day.

2
00:00:11.066 --> 00:00:13.729
"There's a strange truck parked outside.

3
00:00:13.730 --> 00:00:17.414
It's as big as a small house!"

4
00:00:17.415 --> 00:00:21.659
"That's called an RV," Horse said.

5
00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:25.376
"I bet the family is going on a trip."

6
00:00:25.377 --> 00:00:33.663
"A trip?" Rabbit thought. "What's that?"

7
00:00:33.664 --> 00:00:41.046
All morning the family rushed around.

8
00:00:41.047 --> 00:00:44.646
Dad came into the playroom, smiling.

9
00:00:44.647 --> 00:00:46.727
He was holding a suitcase.

10
00:00:46.728 --> 00:00:50.116
"Who's ready for the best road trip ever?"

11
00:00:50.117 --> 00:00:53.931
"I am!" Henry jumped up.

12
00:00:53.932 --> 00:01:01.993
Then Dad and Henry left the playroom.

13
00:01:01.994 --> 00:01:06.125
"Wait!" Henry cried from the stairs.

14
00:01:06.126 --> 00:01:11.837
Henry ran back into the playroom.

15
00:01:11.838 --> 00:01:15.873
"I almost forgot you, Rabbit!" he said.

16
00:01:15.874 --> 00:01:21.818
Robot gave Rabbit a mean look.

17
00:01:21.819 --> 00:01:23.810
But Rabbit was happy. "Hooray!"

18
00:01:23.811 --> 00:01:33.644
he thought. "I'm going with Henry!" The

19
00:01:33.645 --> 00:01:38.153
family and Rabbit got into the RV. Mom

20
00:01:38.154 --> 00:01:49.626
started the engine. Then

21
00:01:49.627 --> 00:01:56.679
they drove and drove and drove. Rabbit

22
00:01:56.680 --> 00:02:01.569
loved watching the trees go by. Suddenly

23
00:02:01.570 --> 00:02:06.357
Rabbit spotted something alongside the road. "Wait

24
00:02:06.358 --> 00:02:08.738
a minute," he thought. "Was

25
00:02:08.739 --> 00:02:10.759
that a rabbit?" Were

26
00:02:10.760 --> 00:02:14.560
there rabbits who lived outside ?

27
00:02:14.561 --> 00:02:16.802
Rabbit couldn't believe it!

28
00:02:16.803 --> 00:02:21.442
As Mom kept driving, Henry fell asleep.

29
00:02:21.443 --> 00:02:26.024
But Rabbit stayed awake with so many questions.

30
00:02:26.025 --> 00:02:29.267
What were the outside rabbits like?

31
00:02:29.268 --> 00:02:33.802
Did they have a kid to play with too?

32
00:02:33.803 --> 00:02:40.965
Would he meet any real rabbits on this trip?

